sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Student
  participant C as Client
  participant AI as AI Assistant Service
  participant X as Context Builder
  participant KB as Knowledge Base
  participant L as LLM Provider
  participant SF as Safety Filter
  participant DB as Database

  S->>C: ask question
  C->>AI: POST /ai/query (+ sessionId)
  AI->>X: build context
  X->>DB: read session, current step, experiment
  X->>KB: retrieve relevant passages
  KB-->>X: grounded passages
  X-->>AI: assembled prompt
  AI->>L: request completion
  L-->>AI: draft response
  AI->>SF: screen response
  SF-->>AI: approved / rewritten / refused
  AI->>DB: log AIInteraction
  AI-->>C: educational response
  C-->>S: display guidance
